            "description": {
              "value": "With a wresting of will, you siphon off a creature's mental energy to replenish your own. One non-mindless creature within 30 feet must attempt a Will save against your spell DC.\n\nSuccess: The creature is unaffected.\nFailure: The creature is stupefied 1 for 1 minute, and you regain 1 Focus Point, up to your normal maximum. You can't use Brain Drain again until after the next time you make your daily preparations.\nCritical Failure: As failure, but the creature is stupefied 2."
            }
          }
